Package: qr2l
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27), libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Stefano Caronia <stefano.caronia@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/stefanocaronia/qr2l
Description: Minimalistic QR code generator (command line and desktop app)
 qr2l generates QR codes from the command line (qr2l) or from a desktop
 application (qr2l-gui). It exports to PNG, SVG, PDF, BMP, JPEG, WebP and
 PostScript, supports custom colors and an embedded logo, and detects the
 content type automatically: URLs, email, phone numbers, SMS, WhatsApp,
 WiFi credentials, geolocation, contacts and calendar events.
